   "id": "docs/01_method/truss_method.md#coaching-priority",
   "file": "docs/01_method/truss_method.md",
   "title": "The TRUSS Method",
   "heading": "Coaching priority",
   "text": "Coach the earliest weak beam that caused downstream failure. If the recommendation missed because discovery was incomplete, coach Understand before Solve. If the buyer would not share information because expectations were unclear, coach Trust before discovery technique."
