   "text": "Financing can make necessary work feasible, but it increases the obligation to disclose. Coach representatives to explain cash price, financed amount, APR or required disclosures supplied by the finance provider, term, payment, promotional conditions, fees, and consequences of deferred-interest structures when applicable. TRUSS does not interpret a lender contract or tell a customer what credit product is best for them."
